1
00:05:28,235 --> 00:05:34,235
It's all about payback.

2
00:10:56,470 --> 00:11:02,470
Thick as Thieves is a drama, action, comedy film directed by Scott Sanders.

3
00:16:24,705 --> 00:16:30,705
Two master thieves go at odds with one another as
one sets the other up for a crime.

4
00:21:52,941 --> 00:21:58,941
The first, a suave pro who does his job and then hides in his own privacy,
listening to old jazz records and caring for his ailing dog, Wally.

5
00:27:21,176 --> 00:27:27,176
The other is a local gangster with a taste for the finer
life, who decides to eliminate the competition.

6
00:32:49,411 --> 00:32:55,411
This ignites a war between the two men and their aides.

7
00:38:17,647 --> 00:38:23,647
An angry mob boss and a female police officer try to sort
the mess before things get too out of hand.

8
00:43:45,882 --> 00:43:51,882
Mackin, played by Alec Baldwin.

9
00:49:14,117 --> 00:49:20,117
Dink, played by Andre Braugher.

10
00:54:42,352 --> 00:54:48,352
Pointy, played by Michael Jai White.

11
01:00:10,588 --> 01:00:16,588
Petrone, played by Rebecca De Mornay.

12
01:05:38,823 --> 01:05:44,823
Waiter, played by Mark Adair-Rios.

13
01:11:07,058 --> 01:11:13,058
Janet, played by Khandi Alexander.

14
01:16:35,294 --> 01:16:41,294
Thick as Thieves is a 1999 American crime film based on the novel of the same name by Patrick Quinn
and adapted for the screen by Scott Sanders and Arthur Krystal, with Sanders directing.

15
01:22:03,529 --> 01:22:09,529
The film stars Alec Baldwin, Andre Braugher, Michael Jai
White, Bruce Greenwood and Rebecca De Mornay.

16
01:27:31,764 --> 01:27:37,764
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
